      "rationale": "This loop-summary rule exactly corresponds to the loop-connection reachability claim proved first by prove.sh through loop-spec.k against verification-core-kompiled, whose VERIFICATION-CORE module does not contain the rule; that proof prints #Top before verification.k is compiled.",
